OL,3,GNEWSALifelong Blues fan returns to
OL,4,Astadium after four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifelong Blues fan has made an
OL,7,Femotional return to Birmingham City's
OL,8,Fstadium, after being unable to visit
OL,9,Ffor four years due to health problems.
OL,11,FMark Hands, a resident at Heathview
OL,12,FRose Care Home in Shirley, Solihull,
OL,13,Fused to regularly attend matches with
OL,14,Fhis friends until he developed
OL,15,Fpermanent reduced mobility.
OL,17,FHowever, the care home arranged a
OL,18,Fspecial stadium tour for Hands, knowing
OL,19,Fhow much the club still meant to the
OL,20,F65-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
